{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_07FF00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"那件事的准备正在稳步推进。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"没有人发现，是我放走了Zadornov。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"今天，我和Amanda一起教Cécile做gallo pinto。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"gallo pinto是把<R=黑豆,FRIJOLES>和<R=　米　,ARROZ>混在一起的朴素家常菜。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=黑豆,FRIJOLES>\", \"<R=　米　,ARROZ>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这道菜不只在哥斯达黎加，在整个中美洲都很有名，所以身为<R=尼加拉瓜人,NICA>的Amanda似乎也很拿手。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=尼加拉瓜人,NICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过，我从记事起就在<R=美国,STATES>长大，几乎连母亲做的gallo pinto是什么味道都想不起来了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国,STATES>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"陪着没心没肺的Cécile和自诩革命家的Amanda聊天，实在烦人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"话虽如此，要是态度太冷淡也可能引起怀疑，我只能陪着她们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"尤其Cécile就是录下那盘磁带的人，必须格外小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Miller他们似乎误以为，我只是擅自把找到的磁带当成朋友录的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"总之，再怎么小心也不为过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……首先，大家把大蒜和香草切碎，再和从昨天就泡在水里的豆子一起煮。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"等豆子煮的时候，用平底锅炒洋葱和<R=米,ARROZ>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=米,ARROZ>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"Amanda不停指挥拿着平底锅的Cécile，Cécile看起来有点嫌烦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"毕竟是法国人，她做菜本身似乎很拿手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"接着往平底锅里加水，等米饭煮熟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"这段时间里，Amanda跟我们讲起了母亲的回忆。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"听说她也因为Somoza和母亲分开了，不过“妈妈的味道”倒记得很清楚。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"豆子煮好后还得倒掉水，再和剩下的蔬菜一起炒。虽说是家常菜，步骤却相当复杂。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不过，忙一点反而正好。聊得太久，暴露身份的可能性也会增加。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"和女人相处，光装得可爱还不够。为了不引起怀疑，必须格外费心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"<R=米,ARROZ>煮好后和豆子拌在一起，再加入salsa继续翻炒。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=米,ARROZ>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"炒着炒着，不知为什么话题转到了恋爱上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"为什么女人聚在一起，就总会聊到这种话题？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"Cécile似乎恋爱经验相当丰富，给Amanda提了各种建议。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"那倒也罢了，可她居然还问我有没有喜欢的人，实在让人生气。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"我本想用“现在没有”敷衍过去，她却追问：“你喜欢Snake吧？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"我嫌麻烦，只好顺着话说了句“也许吧”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"Cécile还点着头说什么“他挺性感的吧”。真是没心没肺。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"我光是活下去就已经竭尽全力，从没想过什么恋爱。我对那种男人没兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"没多久，香喷喷的味道飘了起来，gallo pinto做好了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"大概是闻出我们在做饭，Nuke跑来蹭我们的腿，可惜这并不是什么猫会喜欢的食物。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"我们决定让士兵们试吃，便一起去了食堂。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"意外吃到这份“妈妈的味道”，MSF的士兵们高兴得不得了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"我可没打算讨他们欢心。再说，这种程度的料理我也做得出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"Snake倒是也吃得很高兴……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"再说一遍，我对那种男人没有兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}